@startuml
' Lecturer Support Agent — editable PlantUML source
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title Institution Administrator Manages Users and Roles
actor "Institution Administrator" as IA
participant UI
participant Authorization as Auth
participant "Identity/Tenant Service" as Tenant
participant "Policy Service" as Policy
participant Audit
IA -> UI : add/import user or assign role
UI -> Auth : verify Institution Admin tenant scope
Auth --> UI : allowed
UI -> Tenant : validate user and unit
Tenant -> Policy : validate independent role/scope
Policy --> Tenant : valid/conflict
Tenant -> Audit : append user/role event
Tenant --> UI : result/effective permissions
note over IA,UI
No Head of Department or confidential
academic-content authority is implied.
end note
@enduml
